Z||000000||West Coast Fiero||10-09-2001||01:26 PM||||For all members of West Coast Fiero, and all future members - there will be an open house here at West Coast Fiero on October 13th. Acvtivities will include tech sessions, Q&A session, and and general synopsis of the Fiero.<P> There will be a fully stocked bar, as well as a menu ranging from grilled burgers and hot dogs to BBQ'd steak and ribs. We also will be serving a vegatarian menu.<P> For further details on this event contact either Chris West or Eric Nelson at West Coast Fiero at 310-305-4111 or cwest@cwestco.com<P>Looking forward to seeing everybody<P>------------------<BR>Technician, West Coast Fiero<BR>www.cwestco.com<BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
